EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}So listen to this!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} The other day I
went to a spa with a friend from
back home!{{TAG:0009:0003:10001100120013001400}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oye, ¡¿sabes qué?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡El otro día
me fui a un balneario con una
vieja amiga!{{TAG:0009:0003:10001100120013001400}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tiens, j'ai une anecdote !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} L'autre
fois, j'ai passé l'week-end dans un
centre de spa avec une copine !{{TAG:0009:0003:10001100120013001400}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Senti qua!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} L'altro giorno sono
andata alle terme con una mia
vecchia amica!{{TAG:0009:0003:10001100120013001400}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Zieh dir das mal rein!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich war
neulich mit 'nem Kumpel aus
meiner Heimatstadt in 'nem Spa!{{TAG:0009:0003:10001100120013001400}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Şunu dinle!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Geçenlerde eski
kasabamdan bir arkadaşımla
spa'ya gittim!{{TAG:0009:0003:10001100120013001400}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}I just recently realized this, but{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I kind of have a thing for telling
fortunes and guessing the future.{{TAG:0009:0003:34003500360037003800}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}J'ai découvert ça tout récemment,
mais{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} j'crois que chuis passionnée
par tout c'qui touche à la voyance !{{TAG:0009:0003:34003500360037003800}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Irgendwie find ich Esoterik cool! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich
behaupte zwar immer das Gegenteil,
aber wer wird da kleinlich sein{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0009:0003:34003500360037003800}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}You need some sandwich magic!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Try whipping one up for a snack!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I prefer to not put anything in it.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I just butter the bread!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Eat that, and you'll feel nice and full{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
and sleep till morning!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Ti serve un po' dell'energia che solo
le fette biscottate ti danno!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Prova
a mangiarne una come spuntino!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Io preferisco non metterci niente...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
a parte il burro!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mangiane e ti sentirai {{TAG:000E:0006:1600620065006C006C006F0020007000690065006E006F001600620065006C006C00610020007000690065006E006100}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
pront{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} per dormire fino al giorno
dopo!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Focalise-toi sur ta respiration !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Inspire et expire profondément, ça
va t'calmer et t'faire pioncer !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Prova a respirare profondamente.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Aiuta a rilassarsi e ad
addormentarsi, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Oh! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Sì, anche io la penso così!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
E non può mancare uno strato
di formaggio e prosciutto!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Dai, sapevo che avresti fatto parte
della squadra delle patate al forno
come me!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Oh my gosh! They're so good that
way!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} I like to do a little taterscaping
and make a path for a gravy river!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Pour it on, and let that gravy river
just gush over the gravyfall and
flood the mashed-potato plains!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Oh, m'en parle pas ! C'est un d'mes
plats préférés depuis qu'chuis toute
petiote !{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Tu vas p't'être crier au sacrilège,
mais à l'occase, j'rechigne pas à y
mélanger quelques carottes !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ah, sì! Il purè di patate non è
niente male davvero!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Ne farei una
montagna, con un fiume di salsa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sì, un fiume che si trasforma
in una cascata, pronta a sgorgare
sugli altopiani di purea!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ich sabber schon!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Püree ist so was
von guuuut!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Richtig dekadent wird's
mit Käse und frischen Kräutern!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Halaaa! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}¡Patatitas fritas! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¡Claro!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Yo no como otra cosa a diario,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡soy superfán!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Con kétchup, mostaza, mayonesa,
salsa tártara...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡Yo creo que les
va bien cualquier cosa!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}J'crois que j'pourrais me nourrir
exclusivement de pommes de terre,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Aaa!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Şimdi patates istiyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Hemen sipariş vereceğim! {{TAG:0003:000F:}}Bir de{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
kocaman bir patates evinde
yaşamak müthiş olmaz mıydı! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hein ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Ça veut dire{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} que tu t'fais
jamais de bons p'tits plats,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Alors qu'en fait, c'est super fun !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
C'est aussi bien meilleur quand tu
prépares tout toi-même !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}At first I thought maybe they were
trying to pick a fight or something, 
so I had my guard up, but{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Claro, lo primero que pensé fue que
estaba buscando pelea, así que
ya me estaba mentalizando{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}All'inizio ho pensato che stesse
cercando una scusa per litigare.
Perciò ero sulla difensiva, ma{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}İlk başta kavga çıkarmaya
çalışıyor sandım, o yüzden
gardımı aldım ama{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I thought maybe they were gonna
confess some secrets to me, so I
was feeling kinda nauseous, but{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ho creduto che volesse
confidarmi qualche segreto.
Avevo già la nausea, ma{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}C'était juste pour m'offrir un
cadeau !{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Drôle d'endroit pour ça,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Voleva solo ridarmi un libro!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
Non c'era bisogno di fare così tanto
i misteriosi, però. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Sabah {{TAG:0005:000C:}} burcu kötü çıkarsa bütün
günüm bozuluyor! {{TAG:0003:0015:}}O yüzden artık
falı günün sonunda okuyorum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Böylece bir şey ters giderse
suçu şansa atabiliyorum! {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
Akıllıca, değil mi? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, scary camp stories
are a summer thing, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Do you have any good ones?{{TAG:0008:0001:3F0015004000280041000000}}
Oh, yes.
I'm too chicken.
Well...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, yazın kamp ateşinde
korku hikâyesi anlatılır ya?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}
Senin güzel bir hikâyen var mı?{{TAG:0008:0001:3F0015004000280041000000}}
Var tabii.
Çok korkarım.
Şey...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ahahaha!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I know what you mean!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
I get waaaay too into scary stories,
and then I get freaked out!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}If you told me a scary story right
now, I probably wouldn't sleep for a
week! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ahahaha!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Capisco che vuoi dire!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Mi immedesimo troppo nelle storie
di paura e poi me la faccio sotto!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Se me ne raccontassi una ora,
sono quasi sicura che non dormirei
per una settimana! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ahahaha!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Seni anlıyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Ben de
korku hikâyelerine fazla
kaptırıp sonra ödüm patlıyor! {{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Şimdi bana korkunç bir hikâye
anlatsan bir hafta uyuyamam! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Gnarf! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Erzähl die doch nicht jetzt!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
'ne gute Gruselgeschichte braucht
'n großes Publikum!
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Menno{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Jetzt haste mich total
heiß auf deine Story gemacht!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Also, wenn du die doch noch
zum Besten geben würdest,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
könnte ich nicht weghören!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tiens, question à deux clochettes :{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}quel véhicule te rend le moins
malade ?{{TAG:0008:0001:450000004700000048000000}}
Le train.
Le bateau.
Je galère avec les deux.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ehi, scusa la curiosità, ma...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}qual è il mezzo di trasporto
che ti fa stare meno male?{{TAG:0008:0001:450000004700000048000000}}
Treno.
Barca.
Nessuno dei due.

{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ahahah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Anche per te è così?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}} Sì,
la nausea è una cosa orribile,{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
soprattutto in vacanza!
Se poi si mischia con la nostalgia
di casa, il viaggio diventa un
supplizio! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Muharharhar!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Du auch?{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Reisekrankheiten sind gar nich' so 
selten – {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}vor allem auf Reisen!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Kulaklarla yol tutması arasında
bağlantı olduğunu duydun mu, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Kulakları çok hassas olanların
midesi daha kolay bulanıyormuş!{{TAG:000A:000B:064A004B00CD}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}On one page I wrote something like,
"I'm gonna be {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}
maker and change the world!"{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I don't really remember, but I guess
I used to think that being {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}} maker was cool!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Y'avait ce truc : « Je changerai le
monde en me spécialisant dans
{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}} ! »{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sérieux, comment on peut porter
autant d'intérêt à un truc aussi
futile qu'{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}} ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}A un certo punto avevo scritto:
"Costruirò {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}
e cambierò il mondo!"{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Non mi ricordo assolutamente, ma
forse ero convinta che costruire
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}} fosse tosto!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Bir sayfaya şöyle yazmışım:
'Dünyayı değiştirecek bir {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}
ustası olacağım!'{{TAG:0003:0000:}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Hatırlamıyorum ama galiba {{TAG:000E:0002:}} {{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}
ustası olmak bana çok havalı
geliyormuş!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Au final, ce journal m'a tellement
embarrassée que j'l'ai enterré,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Sometimes in the diary I referred to
my mom as "Mama," which is weird 
because we never called her that!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}We always called her "Mom." But
maybe I secretly wanted to call her
"Mama" sometimes{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}A volte, parlando di mia madre,
ho scritto "mammina". Ma non
la chiamavo mai così!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}La chiamavo sempre "mamma",
ma forse avevo il desiderio
di chiamarla "mammina"{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Da steht ernsthaft drin, dass ich
Katzenfrisöse oder Jumbojetpilotin
werden wollte!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Mein Lieblingsberuf von damals
is' aber immer noch Kosmetikerin.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Nur bin ich gegen Puder allergisch{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
